title: 'cumulus: add slot duration integrity check'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Closes #12307

    This PR adds an integrity check in pallet `aura-ext`'s integrity_test hook.

    The check asserts that the parachain slot duration is a positive multiple of the relay chain's slot duration.
crates:
- name: cumulus-pallet-aura-ext
  bump: minor
